        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Chadwick\n- Companies: Game Designers' Workshop, GDW, SFC Press\n- Products: En Garde!, A House Divided\n- Topics: game design, publishing, postal games, magazines, games events\n\nFacts:\n- In 1975, Game Designers' Workshop (GDW) first published En Garde!.\n- En Garde! was designed by Frank Chadwick.\n- Frank Chadwick is an American multiple-award-winning game designer and a New York Times best-selling author.\n- SFC Press was a UK games company that published En Garde!.\n- SFC Press ran postal games, published the magazine Games Games Games, and ran games events.\n- In 1981, Game Designers Workshop released A House Divided.\n- A House Divided was designed by Frank Chadwick.",
